2. Bundled cloud-provider icon assets  —  NOT MIT; each provider's own terms
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT grant above does NOT apply to the cloud-provider service icons, nor to
the compact "vector pack" data derived from them, that this package bundles
(under `svg/<provider>/` and the generated packs). Those icons are the property
of their respective providers — Amazon Web Services, Inc. (AWS), Microsoft
Corporation (Azure), and Google LLC (Google Cloud) — and are included ONLY under
each provider's own architecture-/service-icon terms, which permit use in
architecture diagrams. They are trademarks and artwork of those providers.

Neither Ali Malik, the Nodus project, nor the MIT grant in Section 1 conveys to
you any right, title, or interest in those providers' trademarks or artwork, and
nothing here is an endorsement by, or affiliation with, any provider.

Before you redistribute this package, ship a product built on it, or otherwise
use the bundled artwork, YOU are responsible for reviewing and complying with
each provider's then-current icon terms. See:

  - `NOTICE`                    — attribution and the source toolkits
  - `LICENSES/aws.md`           — AWS Architecture Icons terms & link
  - `LICENSES/azure.md`         — Azure Architecture Icons terms & link
  - `LICENSES/gcp.md`           — Google Cloud icons terms & link
  - `README.md`                 — usage notes and the curation policy

If you do not agree to a provider's icon terms, do not use that provider's
icons from this package.


